    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d38-a13">

                <pb facs="0814" n="804" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv09/pg804"/>

                <head>Appendix K to HD–122</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">polish
                            delegation<lb/>to the peace conference</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-12-19">December 19, 1919</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">To: The Secretary-General of the Peace Conference.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">From: The Polish Delegation.</p>
                <p>After having learned the reasons for the modification of the Arrangement of
                    September 10th regarding the contribution towards <pb facs="0815" n="805"
                        xml:id="pg805"/> the costs of liberation of the territories of the former
                    Austro-Hungarian Monarchy,<anchor n="15" xml:id="d38-f1"/> and considering that
                    the modifications proposed do not correspond to the interests of Poland, the
                    Polish Delegation has the honor to solicit that, as far as Poland is concerned,
                    the Arrangement which she signed, together with the Allied and Associated
                    Powers, September 10, 1919, be maintained.</p>
                <p>The Polish Delegation at the same time takes the liberty of expressing its keen
                    regret that it did not have the opportunity to present, at an earlier date, its
                    point of view in this respect.</p>
                <p>Please accept, etc.</p>
                <closer>[No signature on file copy]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
